    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>266772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>食材屋　べジット</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grocery Store - Veggie</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ、
食材屋「ベジット」でござい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello, and welcome to
the grocery store, "Veggie."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お腹空きペコな
ぼっちゃんたちは
おたくたち？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you little ones
have a big rumbly
in your tumbly?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>満腹イッパイになってね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hope you two will stuff
yourselves silly!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今晩のおかず
何にしようかしら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder what sides I should
make with dinner tonight...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ブウサギ焼き、リブガロソテー
のこのおひたし……
迷うわ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Roast rappig, sautéed
rhybgaro, noko salad...
I just can't decide...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>夕飯、何にしようかしら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What should I make for dinner...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだわ！　昨日捕まえた
いたずら好きの
ブッシュベイビーを……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I know! I'll just take the
prank-loving bush baby
we caught last night and...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今晩は何食べようかしら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder what we should eat tonight...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーん……
この店には目ぼしい
食材がないわねぇ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... None of the
ingredients in this shop
really jump out at me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんかもっとこう、はっときて
ぐっとくるような食べ物
ないかしら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is there really nothing that
will just grab me and say,
"Take me! Eat me! Now!"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>口に入れた瞬間、
舌の上にびびびっと来るような
刺激的なヤツね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The moment I put it in my
mouth, I want it to feel like
it's dancing on my tongue.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今夜のメインディッシュは
ピヨピヨポン酢で決まりだわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our main dish tonight will
be General Tso's peepit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結婚生活には
いつも新鮮な驚きが
必要なのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When you're married,
you need a lot of fresh,
exciting things in your life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>食卓は結婚生活の
いわば戦場のようなもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The dinner table is kind of like the
proverbial battlefield of married life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全力でいく、
手を抜けば
死あるのみ！なのよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You have to give it your all.
If you let up even for a moment,
only death awaits you! You know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
